Alan compiler and editor support

The MIT License in LICENSE covers the work of Savvas Leousis in this
repository. It does not cover the files listed below, which come from the
Compilers course of the School of Electrical and Computer Engineering,
National Technical University of Athens (NTUA). Their authors keep all
rights to them.

- symbol.cpp, symbol.hpp, general.cpp, general.hpp, error.cpp, error.hpp
  Generic symbol table and error handler, written by Nikolaos S. Papaspyrou
  (Software Engineering Laboratory, NTUA), 2003-2004. Modified for this
  compiler.

- alan_lib_v2/
  The x86-64 assembly runtime library provided with the course.

- alan2018.pdf
  The Alan language specification of the course, 2018.

The compiler bundles also contain Zig (MIT License, in the zig folder of each
bundle) and code from LLVM (Apache License 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions).
